{"id":"2cd98554615471be","group":"93","path":"93/93-cor-ultraproduct-finite.md","title":"Ultraproduct Finite","display":"Ultraproduct Finite","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-cor-ultraproduct-finite","aliases":["93-cor-ultraproduct-finite"],"display":"Ultraproduct Finite","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-finite-algebra]]","[[93-df-cardinality]]","[[93-df-ultraproduct]]","[[93-df-set-ultrafilter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-cor-ultraproduct-finite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-cor-ultraproduct-finite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Ultraproduct Finite"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" href=\"?note=32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" title=\"93-df-finite-algebra\">93-df-finite-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1734624324342672\" href=\"?note=1734624324342672\" title=\"93-df-cardinality\">93-df-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"77d2ef3450d9750f\" href=\"?note=77d2ef3450d9750f\" title=\"93-df-ultraproduct\">93-df-ultraproduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7cc13e0d91069bbd\" href=\"?note=7cc13e0d91069bbd\" title=\"93-df-set-ultrafilter\">93-df-set-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"cor-ultraproduct-finite---Ultraproduct-Finite\">cor-ultraproduct-finite - Ultraproduct Finite</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(I\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}\\)</span> are sourced from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" href=\"?note=32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" title=\"93-df-finite-algebra\">93-df-finite-algebra</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1734624324342672\" href=\"?note=1734624324342672\" title=\"93-df-cardinality\">93-df-cardinality</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"77d2ef3450d9750f\" href=\"?note=77d2ef3450d9750f\" title=\"93-df-ultraproduct\">93-df-ultraproduct</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;I\\in V\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A(i))\\land\n\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(|\\mathbf A(i)|,n)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;I\\in V\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A(i))\\land\n\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(|\\mathbf A(i)|,n)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>A common finite bound, not merely pointwise finiteness, is essential. The predicate is the ultrafilter-on-a-set predicate, not the Boolean-algebra ultrafilter predicate.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"cor-ultraproduct-finite---Ultraproduct-Finite","text":"cor-ultraproduct-finite - Ultraproduct Finite","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"32c4e6b205cc3cd8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-finite-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"1734624324342672","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"77d2ef3450d9750f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-ultraproduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"7cc13e0d91069bbd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I\\in V$, $I\\ne\\varnothing$, $\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$, and $\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"32c4e6b205cc3cd8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}$, $\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}$ are sourced from [[93-df-finite-algebra]], [[93-df-cardinality]], and [[93-df-ultraproduct]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"1734624324342672","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}$, $\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}$ are sourced from [[93-df-finite-algebra]], [[93-df-cardinality]], and [[93-df-ultraproduct]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"77d2ef3450d9750f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}$, $\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}$ are sourced from [[93-df-finite-algebra]], [[93-df-cardinality]], and [[93-df-ultraproduct]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&I\\in V\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A(i))\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall i\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A(i))\\land\n\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}(|\\mathbf A(i)|,n)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1373,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["6730349967b8ffce","32c4e6b205cc3cd8","1734624324342672","77d2ef3450d9750f","7cc13e0d91069bbd"]}